## Common Query Patterns

### Partial Match (Starts With)
```java
@Query("SELECT o FROM Owner o WHERE o.lastName LIKE :lastName%")
Collection<Owner> findByLastName(@Param("lastName") String lastName);
```

### Eager Fetch Children
```java
@Query("SELECT DISTINCT o FROM Owner o LEFT JOIN FETCH o.pets WHERE o.lastName LIKE :lastName%")
Collection<Owner> findByLastName(@Param("lastName") String lastName);
```

### Find by Foreign Key
```java
@Query("SELECT v FROM Visit v WHERE v.pet.id = :petId")
List<Visit> findByPetId(@Param("petId") Integer petId);
```

### Find by Multiple Values
```java
@Query("SELECT s FROM Specialty s WHERE s.name IN :names")
List<Specialty> findSpecialtiesByNameIn(@Param("names") Set<String> names);
```

