## Common Mistakes to Avoid

| ❌ Don't | ✅ Do |
|----------|------|
| Forget `@Profile("spring-data-jpa")` | Always add profile annotation |
| Cause N+1 queries | Use `LEFT JOIN FETCH` |
| Use positional parameters | Use named parameters with `@Param` |
| Return `List<>` | Return `Collection<>` for flexibility |
| Forget `throws DataAccessException` | Add to all methods |
